{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-knot-operator-energy-consumers","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:knot-operator-energy-consumers","kind":"remark","title":"Consumers: gluon-channel selection by energy minimisation","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-knot-operator-energy","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-proton","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-neutron"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-knot-operator-energy","tags":["knot-operator","gluon-channel","proton","neutron","energy-minimisation"],"text":"knot-operator-energy-consumers.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:knot-operator-energy-consumers\"></a><p><strong>Remark (consumers: gluon-channel selection by energy minimisation).</strong>\nThe <a href=\"#def:categorical-proton\">proton</a> and <a href=\"#def:categorical-neutron\">neutron</a> select gluon-stabilisation channels by minimising the <a href=\"#def:knot-operator-energy\">knot operator energy</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">E(\\lambda, q)</code> across partitions of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_3(q)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/knot-operator-energy-consumers.md","heading":"Remark","number":"12.4.3"}
